    },
    {
      "text": "くちから　はきだす　とくべつ\nあつい　ほのおで　こうげきする。\nあいての　とくこうを　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "입에서 내뱉는 아주\n뜨거운 불꽃으로 공격한다.\n상대의 특수공격을 떨어뜨린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從口中吐出特別灼熱的\n火焰進行攻擊。\n可降低對手的特攻。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Attaque avec des flammes brûlantes soufflées\nde la bouche du lanceur. Diminue l’Attaque Spéciale\nde l’ennemi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Anwender greift das Ziel an, indem er ihm\neine besondere, heiße Flamme entgegenbläst.\nDer Spezial-Angriff des Zieles sinkt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario lanza por la boca una singular llama a gran\ntemperatura con la que ataca a su oponente y baja su\nAtaque Especial.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Colpisce il bersaglio soffiandogli contro delle\nfiammate incredibilmente roventi, riducendone\nl’Attacco Speciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user attacks by breathing a special, hot fire.\nThis also lowers the target’s Sp. Atk stat.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "口から　吐きだす　特別\n熱い　炎で　攻撃する。\n相手の　特攻を　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "从口中喷出特别灼热的\n火焰进行攻击。\n降低对手的特攻。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
